          "To scale consumption horizontally without complex manual coordination, streaming architectures introduce the Consumer Group abstraction. Technical debt in this component should be tracked explicitly and prioritised alongside feature work, because deferred maintenance eventually manifests as production incidents or development slowdowns that cost more.",
