          "While Range assignment is straightforward, it can produce severe partition imbalance when consumers subscribe to multiple topics. The transition from a single-region deployment to a multi-region active-active setup demands revisiting every assumption about consistency, ordering, and timeout values in this part of the system.",
          "In contrast, the Round-Robin Assignor pools all partitions across all subscribed topics together and distributes them in a cyclic round-robin. Capacity planning exercises rely on accurate models of how this component behaves under increasing load, making performance characterization an ongoing responsibility rather than a one-time task.",
          "Worker 1 receives partition 0, Worker 2 receives partition 1, Worker 1 receives partition 2, and so on. Disaster recovery testing reveals whether this design can handle the sudden loss of an entire availability zone without data loss or prolonged downtime, which is a non-negotiable requirement.",
          "Round-Robin assignment ensures that total partition load is distributed with maximum uniformity across all consumer workers. Automated canary deployments that gradually shift traffic to a new version of this component allow you to detect regressions before they affect the entire user base across the platform.",
