          "A high-throughput streaming engine must provide continuous, high-resolution telemetry to operations teams. Many experienced engineers consider this foundational knowledge because it appears in some form across almost every large-scale system built in the last decade. The practical value of mastering this topic becomes apparent during code reviews and architecture meetings where you must justify design tradeoffs with concrete reasoning.",
