          "Because our state was checkpointed at the exact same offset where the consumer committed, re-consumption restarts from that offset. The transition from a single-region deployment to a multi-region active-active setup demands revisiting every assumption about consistency, ordering, and timeout values in this part of the system.",
          "Furthermore, by using idempotent message IDs or transactional offset commits, re-consumed records do not duplicate balances. Capacity planning exercises rely on accurate models of how this component behaves under increasing load, making performance characterization an ongoing responsibility rather than a one-time task. Disaster recovery testing reveals whether this design can handle the sudden loss of an entire availability zone without data loss or prolonged downtime, which is a non-negotiable requirement.",
          "The combination of periodic checkpoints, tail changelog deduplication, and atomic offset commits creates end-to-end EOS. Automated canary deployments that gradually shift traffic to a new version of this component allow you to detect regressions before they affect the entire user base across the platform.",
