          "Alternatively, downstream database sinks use idempotent UPSERT statements (ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE) to safely overwrite state. Shared ownership of this component, where any team member can confidently make changes, requires comprehensive tests, clear documentation, and regular knowledge-sharing sessions that build collective expertise.",
