          "These alerts integrate directly into PagerDuty, Slack webhooks, and Kubernetes Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA) triggers. Cross-team dependencies on this component should be managed through versioned interfaces and change notifications so that upstream changes do not silently break downstream consumers or introduce regressions.",
          "Deploying robust telemetry monitors transforms stream processing from a black box into a transparent, self-healing system. Celebrating when the team catches a potential issue in this area during code review reinforces the culture of careful engineering and encourages thorough reviews in future pull requests.",
          "Tomorrow, we reach the summit of the course: the Capstone Project, synthesizing all 30 days into a master streaming platform. Technical debt in this component should be tracked explicitly and prioritised alongside feature work, because deferred maintenance eventually manifests as production incidents or development slowdowns that cost more.",
