        "Resilience engineering for Milestone 11 starts with a comprehensive failure mode analysis. Every external dependency — network calls, disk I/O, clock sources, DNS resolution — is catalogued along with its failure characteristics: how it fails, how often, how long failures last, and what the blast radius looks like. The validateCepGuard implementation then includes explicit handling for each identified failure mode, turning unpredictable crashes into predictable, recoverable degradation.",
